          "message": "A02:2025 — Detect AWS secret access key assignments; a committed `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY` can bypass the secret scan.",
          "confidence": 0.95,
          "category": "security",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The Secret scan searches tracked files using a case-sensitive pattern. It matches `AKIA` access key IDs, but has no pattern for an AWS secret access key assignment by itself.",
            "failureScenario": "A contributor commits `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...` without an `AKIA` key ID. The value matches none of the scan patterns, so `git grep` finds no match and the workflow passes with the credential in tracked content (OWASP A02:2025)."
          }
        }
